<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>카카오톡 공유하기</title>
    <!-- 카카오 JS SDK -->
    <script src="https://t1.kakaocdn.net/kakao_js_sdk/2.7.2/kakao.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f5f6f8;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .container {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 32px 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 400px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .icon {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            background-color: #FEE500;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
        }
        .icon svg { width: 36px; height: 36px; fill: #000000; }
        h1 { font-size: 20px; color: #111111; margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: 700; }
        p { font-size: 14px; color: #666666; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.5; }
        .btn-kakao {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px;
            background-color: #FEE500;
            color: #191919;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <div class="icon">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 3c-4.97 0-9 3.185-9 7.115 0 2.557 1.707 4.8 4.27 6.054-.188.702-.682 2.545-.78 2.94-.122.49.178.483.376.352.155-.103 2.466-1.68 3.473-2.368.54.08 1.1.122 1.661.122 4.97 0 9-3.186 9-7.115S16.97 3 12 3z"/>
        </svg>
    </div>
    <h1>카카오톡 메시지 공유</h1>
    <p>아래 버튼을 누르면 카카오톡으로 공유하실 수 있습니다.</p>
    
    <button class="btn-kakao" onclick="shareKakao()">
        카카오톡으로 공유하기
    </button>
</div>

<script>
    // 카카오 SDK 초기화
    Kakao.init('894addf7c40ec6f1c81da3c0bacb9864');

    function shareKakao() {
        Kakao.Share.sendCustom({
            templateId: 135582,
        });
    }
</script>

</body>
</html>
